jtbd-market-discovery plugin

This plugin ports the jtbd-market-discovery plugin, version 1.5.1, from a
private repository of ai-advanced-futures (plugins/jtbd-market-discovery/,
commit c2a329f). Luis F. Amadeo wrote it. It is under the MIT license. This
plugin takes from it the agents, the skills, the scripts, the references, the
templates, the examples, the tests, and the plugin result files, with changes.

